| # | Severity | Test | Action |
|---|----------|------|--------|
| 1 | **Critical** | `Audit_RunsWithoutError` | Add meaningful assertion |
| 2 | **High** | `Replenish_AsyncJob_Completes` | Replace `Thread.Sleep` with `await` or poll loop |
| 3 | **Medium** | `Restock_FromSupplier_UpdatesQuantities` | Document the skip reason or re-enable |
